WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.520
Working at the SCP Foundation can really get
your appetite going.

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:09.460
After spending a rough shift monitoring the
acid levels in SCP-682’s tank, or performing

00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:15.530
the rituals necessary to keep the Devourer
of Worlds on the other side of SCP-2317, sometimes

00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:20.230
you just need a quick snack to hold you over
before you return to the old grind.

00:00:20.230 --> 00:00:23.880
Problem is, at the SCP Foundation, even the
break room can be perilous.

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:28.960
Dr. Dan is notorious for pilfering pudding
cups from the communal fridge, and ever since

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:33.149
The Administrator himself stole your tuna
sandwich, you just don’t feel safe spending

00:00:33.149 --> 00:00:35.609
your lunch break on-site anymore.

00:00:35.609 --> 00:00:40.199
But this presents its own series of issues:
You only have an hour for lunch, and obviously

00:00:40.199 --> 00:00:42.680
you can’t order in due to security issues.

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:46.370
Also, if you’re eating off-site, you have
even less time to finish your lunch, because

00:00:46.370 --> 00:00:49.780
the site you’re currently stationed at is
relatively remote.

00:00:49.780 --> 00:00:53.889
We’re talking at least a half-hour round-trip
to actually get to somewhere, so you’re

00:00:53.889 --> 00:00:55.860
gonna need your food fast.

00:00:55.860 --> 00:01:02.319
And when it comes to fast food, few eateries
are as prolific as the Golden Arches: McDonalds.

00:01:02.319 --> 00:01:04.470
And just to clarify, this video is not sponsored.

00:01:04.470 --> 00:01:08.630
We’re going to tell you about a horrifying
anomalous secret that this company really

00:01:08.630 --> 00:01:10.210
doesn’t want you to know about.

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:12.700
Let’s not think about that just yet, though.

00:01:12.700 --> 00:01:16.510
Your stomach is rumbling, and you need that
quarter pounder so bad that even being trapped

00:01:16.510 --> 00:01:20.340
in the Red Reality with Dr. Scranton couldn’t
stop you from getting it.

00:01:20.340 --> 00:01:24.890
When you finally arrive, you buy your typical
order: A quarter pounder with french fries,

00:01:24.890 --> 00:01:26.780
a coffee, and a McFlurry.

00:01:26.780 --> 00:01:31.201
You see Dr. Clef a few tables down eating
a box of chicken nuggets and ketchup, but

00:01:31.201 --> 00:01:33.280
decide not to engage.

00:01:33.280 --> 00:01:37.170
As you sit and enjoy your meager little lunch,
knowing you’ll probably be coordinating

00:01:37.170 --> 00:01:42.500
the cleaning efforts of SCP-173’s containment
chamber by the end of the day, your eyes drift

00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:49.270
over to something even more unsettling: Happy,
the current mascot for McDonalds Happy Meals.

00:01:49.270 --> 00:01:50.640
You can’t help but shudder.

00:01:50.640 --> 00:01:54.350
You’ve seen some pretty horrifying things
on the job.

00:01:54.350 --> 00:01:55.600
Nightmarish things.

00:01:55.600 --> 00:01:58.469
You fear no monster, but that thing?

00:01:58.469 --> 00:01:59.869
It scares you.

00:01:59.869 --> 00:02:01.649
Those big, soulless eyes.

00:02:01.649 --> 00:02:05.590
The wide, gaping maw full of too-white teeth.

00:02:05.590 --> 00:02:07.499
Its diabolical sneakers.

00:02:07.499 --> 00:02:10.229
No child should ever have to look at that.

00:02:10.229 --> 00:02:15.520
You can’t help but wonder, whatever happened
to Ronald McDonald, the hamburger happy clown

00:02:15.520 --> 00:02:18.210
that’d shilled fast food to you throughout
your childhood?

00:02:18.210 --> 00:02:20.370
What was he up to now?

00:02:20.370 --> 00:02:24.990
Well, we have the answer for you, but I’ll
warn you: You may not be quite as eager to

00:02:24.990 --> 00:02:28.340
suck down a Big Mac and diet coke after hearing
this.

00:02:28.340 --> 00:02:34.650
Ronald McDonald, first introduced as the company
mascot in 1963, had a pretty good run before

00:02:34.650 --> 00:02:39.700
finally being largely phased out by the company
in the mid-2010s for a greater focus on the

00:02:39.700 --> 00:02:42.200
nasty little box homunculus.

00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:46.320
You can thank John Wayne Gacy, Pennywise,
and those goofballs dressing up as clowns

00:02:46.320 --> 00:02:48.310
back in 2016 for that.

00:02:48.310 --> 00:02:53.120
But like anyone who loses favor stateside,
Ronald had a prosperous career ahead of him

00:02:53.120 --> 00:02:54.170
outside of the country.

00:02:54.170 --> 00:02:57.140
Well, not the Ronald we know, at least.

00:02:57.140 --> 00:03:02.880
You see, in an undisclosed cattle farm in
2004, most likely in North America, a monster

00:03:02.880 --> 00:03:03.950
was born.

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:09.950
A horrific abomination, birthed from a cow,
like many have theorized about SCP-058, the

00:03:09.950 --> 00:03:11.340
Heart of Darkness.

00:03:11.340 --> 00:03:15.840
But this nasty little creature wasn’t a
giant heart with a stinger and scorpion legs.

00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:22.480
In many ways, it appeared superficially humanoid,
save for its stark white skin, its thick red

00:03:22.480 --> 00:03:26.450
lips, and its full head of bright, frizzy
red hair.

00:03:26.450 --> 00:03:31.970
But that was only the start of the unnerving
strangeness exhibited by this miracle child.

00:03:31.970 --> 00:03:38.280
It was born with white gloves and long, clownish
shoes seemingly grafted to its feet.

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:42.540
Fresh from birth, the creature was huge, with
a disproportionately large head and wide,

00:03:42.540 --> 00:03:46.200
disgusting pores that seemed to perpetually
leak fry oil.

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:50.650
The creature was unresponsive to any kind
of external stimuli, perhaps suggesting it

00:03:50.650 --> 00:03:54.420
was braindead, and it remained completely
dormant most of the time.

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:58.790
While most people would have screamed, run
away, or called the police, the farmers at

00:03:58.790 --> 00:04:03.320
this particular cattle farm decided to let
it ride, and see how this whole nightmarish

00:04:03.320 --> 00:04:05.040
affair played out.

00:04:05.040 --> 00:04:09.260
That sense of curiosity and patience would
soon pay off for them financially.

00:04:09.260 --> 00:04:12.700
It didn’t take long for the creature to
grow.

00:04:12.700 --> 00:04:16.980
The bigger it got, the more it looked like
a giant, mutant version of McDonalds’ iconic

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:19.150
mascot, Ronald McDonald.

00:04:19.150 --> 00:04:21.280
And this wasn’t just a coincidence, either.

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:26.600
It turned out that this monster was somehow
intrinsically linked to the McDonalds brand,

00:04:26.600 --> 00:04:32.130
because once a day, the creature would horrifically
unhinge its jaw, and begin to barf out a huge

00:04:32.130 --> 00:04:34.100
quantity of McDonalds food.

00:04:34.100 --> 00:04:38.200
And we’re not talking about raw materials
that are then converted into McDonalds food.

00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:45.350
The creature, later dubbed SCP-5962, vomited
out fully-packaged McDonalds products.

00:04:45.350 --> 00:04:49.750
The owners of this clownish monster had just
hit the lottery - so to speak.

00:04:49.750 --> 00:04:54.200
While the particulars of the deal are unclear,
they somehow contacted a representative of

00:04:54.200 --> 00:04:56.660
the McDonalds corporation based in China.

00:04:56.660 --> 00:05:01.210
In exchange for presumably a large sum of
money, Chinese McDonalds operatives covertly

00:05:01.210 --> 00:05:05.660
entered the country and shepherded the now-massive
creature over to a McDonalds-owned warehouse

00:05:05.660 --> 00:05:06.990
in Beijing.

00:05:06.990 --> 00:05:11.100
By this point, it was around four meters tall
and weighed over five tons.

00:05:11.100 --> 00:05:17.470
It was kept inside a cage and housed at some
cost, but soon enough, the creature was paying

00:05:17.470 --> 00:05:19.000
for itself.

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:24.130
As we mentioned before, the creature constantly
secreted fry oil, which was siphoned off for

00:05:24.130 --> 00:05:27.210
use in preparing McDonalds food across the
country.

00:05:27.210 --> 00:05:31.120
The huge quantity of packaged food that it
vomited out every day was also shipped off

00:05:31.120 --> 00:05:35.420
to restaurants across the country, making
the Chinese branch of McDonalds incredibly

00:05:35.420 --> 00:05:37.230
financially successful.

00:05:37.230 --> 00:05:41.580
They were able to make an almost complete
profit on all of these foods and drinks, once

00:05:41.580 --> 00:05:45.240
transport costs were subtracted, of course.

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:50.650
SCP-5962 had become McDonalds China’s best-kept
secret, but of course, no secret this sensational

00:05:50.650 --> 00:05:52.700
could stay under wraps forever.

00:05:52.700 --> 00:05:56.530
No matter how much people in the warehouse
were paid or threatened for their silence,

00:05:56.530 --> 00:06:00.570
if your day job was siphoning grease off of
a giant mutant clown for the purpose of preparing

00:06:00.570 --> 00:06:04.860
McDonalds food across the country, there’d
be no way that you wouldn’t speak to somebody

00:06:04.860 --> 00:06:05.860
about it.

00:06:05.860 --> 00:06:10.710
Nobody knows whose loose lips sunk this incredibly
profitable ship, but rumors began to spread

00:06:10.710 --> 00:06:15.470
around Beijing about a huge clown inside of
a McDonalds packaging facility.

00:06:15.470 --> 00:06:19.910
That was when local field agents of the SCP
Foundation finally took notice.

00:06:19.910 --> 00:06:24.970
Two agents, Johnathan Zhang and George Nagasu,
were dispatched to perform an infiltration

00:06:24.970 --> 00:06:27.660
mission along with a team of backup personnel.

00:06:27.660 --> 00:06:31.190
They entered the warehouse, apprehending any
employees they found.

00:06:31.190 --> 00:06:35.650
As they and their reinforcements reached the
Northern side of the facility, they found

00:06:35.650 --> 00:06:42.710
SCP-5962 with a heavy collar around its neck,
chained to the ground like King Kong, as McDonalds

00:06:42.710 --> 00:06:45.470
employees wheeled away carts of packaged food.

00:06:45.470 --> 00:06:50.389
Neither of the attending agents were fans
of McDonalds food, but even then, just seeing

00:06:50.389 --> 00:06:54.010
this horrible display was enough to make them
feel nauseous.

00:06:54.010 --> 00:06:58.020
The creature was taken and contained by the
SCP Foundation, who conducted a number of

00:06:58.020 --> 00:06:59.270
tests on it.

00:06:59.270 --> 00:07:04.560
They found that the monster had no real internal
organs save for 27 interconnected stomachs.

00:07:04.560 --> 00:07:08.490
Genetically, they also found that the creature
was far more cow than human.

00:07:08.490 --> 00:07:13.980
The same could sadly not be said for the food
that SCP-5962 was vomiting out.

00:07:13.980 --> 00:07:18.130
Seriously, if you were already feeling a little
queasy from all this, we need to warn you

00:07:18.130 --> 00:07:21.020
that this is the part where things get really
vile.

00:07:21.020 --> 00:07:26.590
Let’s talk about what the McDonalds food
barfed up by SCP-5962 was actually made out

00:07:26.590 --> 00:07:27.590
of.

00:07:27.590 --> 00:07:32.070
As we alluded to earlier, the food exuded
by the creature was genetically human, with

00:07:32.070 --> 00:07:36.530
DNA often matching that of people who are
alive and in no way affected by this anomalous

00:07:36.530 --> 00:07:37.690
process.

00:07:37.690 --> 00:07:41.990
Tests have indicated that certain foods, condiments,
and beverages correspond to more specific

00:07:41.990 --> 00:07:44.230
types of bodily tissue and liquid.

00:07:44.230 --> 00:07:47.840
For example, the bacon and fries were shown
to be cartilage and ligaments.

00:07:47.840 --> 00:07:51.370
The bread turned out to be made from hair,
nails, and skin.

00:07:51.370 --> 00:07:53.770
The coffee was liquified fecal matter.

00:07:53.770 --> 00:07:57.510
The chicken nuggets were made from fingers,
ovaries, and testes.

00:07:57.510 --> 00:08:02.190
Even the water was a mix of saline and sweat,
and of course, the ice cream was comprised

00:08:02.190 --> 00:08:07.190
of pus, bone marrow, feces, and nasal mucus,
depending on the flavor.

00:08:07.190 --> 00:08:08.210
You get the idea.

00:08:08.210 --> 00:08:13.130
We’ll stop listing off examples before you
lose your lunch, but rest assured, all the

00:08:13.130 --> 00:08:18.760
food produced by SCP-5962 was made of human
organic matter.

00:08:18.760 --> 00:08:24.520
When the SCP Foundation interviewed Mr. Chen,
the manager of the facility where SCP-5962

00:08:24.520 --> 00:08:29.110
was being held, before his amnestic treatment,
he seemed incredibly casual about the whole

00:08:29.110 --> 00:08:30.110
thing.

00:08:30.110 --> 00:08:33.479
As far as he was concerned, the food still
tasted exactly the same as regular McDonalds

00:08:33.479 --> 00:08:37.620
food, and it didn’t appear to have any adverse
health effects beyond what you could expect

00:08:37.620 --> 00:08:39.919
from regular, non-anomalous fast food.

00:08:39.919 --> 00:08:43.870
It’s actually less cruel and disturbing
than the slaughterhouses where this meat is

00:08:43.870 --> 00:08:45.339
typically obtained.

00:08:45.339 --> 00:08:50.980
Mr. Chen also contested that SCP-5962 wasn’t
at all dangerous, either: The only time it

00:08:50.980 --> 00:08:56.240
ever performed a defensive action was when
an employee of the enemy fast-food franchise,

00:08:56.240 --> 00:08:58.620
Burger King, entered its vicinity.

00:08:58.620 --> 00:09:02.850
The creature vomited a stream of hot coffee
at the corporate interloper like a firehouse

00:09:02.850 --> 00:09:07.619
until he left, suggesting that it does have
some kind of strange inherent loyalty to the

00:09:07.619 --> 00:09:09.129
McDonalds company.

00:09:09.129 --> 00:09:13.790
But still, other than this isolated incident,
the creature had never even displayed sentience.

00:09:13.790 --> 00:09:18.110
It was a big, strange, clownish McDonalds
food dispenser.

00:09:18.110 --> 00:09:23.970
When questioned about the origins of SCP-5962,
Mr. Chen once again underplayed the strangeness

00:09:23.970 --> 00:09:29.779
of the situation, saying that he’d heard
rumors the farm that sold him SCP-5962 had

00:09:29.779 --> 00:09:34.779
also sold other strange, anomalous creatures
to eager buyers in the US.

00:09:34.779 --> 00:09:39.910
The farm - which we can only assume is situated
right next to a radioactive waste dump - was

00:09:39.910 --> 00:09:45.689
also behind SCP-4158, also known as Big Charlie.

00:09:45.689 --> 00:09:49.860
This giant, omnivorous, and seemingly immortal
mutant cow is believed to have been birthed

00:09:49.860 --> 00:09:53.980
from a non-anomalous cow sold to the Butchers
Block Slaughterhouse.

00:09:53.980 --> 00:09:58.720
It looked hideous and seemed to suffer from
a wide variety of health issues, leading to

00:09:58.720 --> 00:10:02.129
the employees at the slaughterhouse trying
to put the creature out of its misery.

00:10:02.129 --> 00:10:07.619
However, no matter how hard they tried to
kill the monster, it just wouldn’t die.

00:10:07.619 --> 00:10:11.720
Its bones were pretty much indestructible,
and no matter how much of its flesh was cut

00:10:11.720 --> 00:10:16.820
off, it just kept growing back, causing no
ill effects to the creature itself.

00:10:16.820 --> 00:10:20.850
Eventually, the slaughterhouse workers tried
cooking and eating the meat, leading to them

00:10:20.850 --> 00:10:24.540
discovering it tasted just as good as non-anomalous
meat.

00:10:24.540 --> 00:10:30.360
Much like the Chinese McDonalds and SCP-5962,
the workers had just hit the lottery with

00:10:30.360 --> 00:10:31.569
Big Charlie.

00:10:31.569 --> 00:10:35.430
As long as they kept feeding the monster,
which ate everything from bricks to other,

00:10:35.430 --> 00:10:41.100
non-anomalous cows, it provided a pretty much
limitless supply of meat, giving them unprecedented

00:10:41.100 --> 00:10:42.929
economic prosperity.

00:10:42.929 --> 00:10:46.860
In other words, Big Charlie was a literal
cash cow.

00:10:46.860 --> 00:10:51.290
Jeff Fine, the slaughterhouse director, even
started worshipping Big Charlie as a kind

00:10:51.290 --> 00:10:53.670
of demi-god by drinking his blood.

00:10:53.670 --> 00:10:57.850
He believed that Big Charlie was a savior,
sent to lift them all out of their struggle

00:10:57.850 --> 00:10:59.529
and desperation.

00:10:59.529 --> 00:11:04.540
Sadly for them, the SCP Foundation sent them
right back when Big Charlie escaped their

00:11:04.540 --> 00:11:08.429
slaughterhouse, and Foundation field agents
found, secured, and contained it.

00:11:08.429 --> 00:11:10.759
It was a sad day for the Butchers Block.

00:11:10.759 --> 00:11:13.179
So, what have we learned today?

00:11:13.179 --> 00:11:17.310
Whether you’re in the US of A or the Chinese
heartland, if you’re chowing down on fast

00:11:17.310 --> 00:11:20.029
food, you really have no idea where it came
from.

00:11:20.029 --> 00:11:24.339
I mean, we kind of knew that already, but
for all we know, the food you’re enjoying

00:11:24.339 --> 00:11:29.360
could have been vomited up by a giant fat
clown, or cut from the flesh of a mutated

00:11:29.360 --> 00:11:30.480
cow.

00:11:30.480 --> 00:11:33.190
Just think about that next time you’re enjoying
a burger.

00:11:33.190 --> 00:11:37.420
But hey, let’s be honest with ourselves,
we’ll all probably still eat it.

00:11:37.420 --> 00:11:42.870
Now go check out “SCP-3166 - Monster Garfield
Attack (Gorefield)” and “Killer Living

00:11:42.870 --> 00:11:49.220
Graffiti SCP-1155 - Predatory Street Art”
for more strange threats from the SCP Foundation!

